SUMMARY:CBC4KIDS (and Adults) - Lancaster Central Park
DESCRIPTION:John Lahr is the coordinator of this CBC4KIDS (and adults) which is designed to introduce young people to winter birding and nature at Lancaster County Central Park.\nA special event with Lancaster County Parks. John Lahr is coordinator of this CBC4KIDS (and adults) which is designed to introduce young people to winter birding and nature at Lancaster County Central Park.  Any adults without children are also encouraged to join the group to experience the beauty of the park in winter and help provide mentorship.  Please contact John (717-205-3030 or johnlahr324@gmail.com) if you have any questions or want to join the group.
URL:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/event/cbc4kids-and-adults-lancaster-central-park-2/
LOCATION:PA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/lancaster-bird-club-04.jpg
END:VEVENT
