SUMMARY:Southern Lancaster Christmas Bird Count (SoLanCo CBC)
DESCRIPTION:All birders are welcome and newcomers will be paired with experienced CBC volunteers.\nDerek Stoner is the coordinator for the SoLanCo CBC.  Contact Derek at (484) 723-3348 or derekstoner@hotmail.com to volunteer and receive instructions and assignments.  All birders are welcome and newcomers will be pared with experienced CBC volunteers.  Birders are also welcome to do a feeder watch count for the CBC\, but you must contact Derek to make sure your property is within the SoLanCo count circle and to receive instructions. \nIMPORTANT NOTE: If CBCing on State Game Lands\, participants must wear blaze orange per new Pennsylvania Game Commission regulations requiring wear on Game Lands Oct. 1 through Jan. 31. Even if not birding Game Lands\, wear of blaze orange is strongly encouraged by anyone recreating in any areas open to hunting during this timeframe.
URL:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/event/southern-lancaster-christmas-bird-count-solanco-cbc/
LOCATION:PA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/lancaster-county-birds-6.jpg
END:VEVENT
