DESCRIPTION:All birders are welcome and newcomers will be paired with experienced CBC volunteers.\nTed Nichols II is the coordinator for the Lititz CBC.  Contact Ted at (717) 856-3851 or tanicholsii@gmail.com to volunteer and receive instructions and assignments. Birders are also welcome to do a feeder watch count for the CBC\, but you must contact Ted to make sure your property is within the Lititz count circle and to receive instructions. \nIMPORTANT NOTE: If CBCing on State Game Lands\, participants must wear blaze orange per new Pennsylvania Game Commission regulations requiring wear on Game Lands Oct. 1 through Jan. 31. Even if not birding Game Lands\, wear of blaze orange is strongly encouraged by anyone recreating in any areas open to hunting during this timeframe.
