SUMMARY:Lancaster Christmas Bird Count
DESCRIPTION:All birders are welcome and newcomers will be paired with experienced CBC volunteers.\nBarbara Hunsberger (phunsberger@comcast.net) is the coordinator for the Lancaster CBC and schedules / assigns volunteers for the count. Call or email Barbara at (717) 575-3712 or phunsberger@comcast.net to receive instructions and assignments. Birders are also welcome to do a feeder watch count for the CBC\, but you must contact Barbara to make sure your property is within the Lancaster count circle and to receive instructions. \nIMPORTANT NOTE: If CBCing on State Game Lands\, participants must wear blaze orange per new Pennsylvania Game Commission regulations requiring wear on Game Lands Oct. 1 through Jan. 31. Even if not birding Game Lands\, wear of blaze orange is strongly encouraged by anyone recreating in any areas open to hunting during this timeframe.
URL:https://lancasterbirdclub.org/event/lancaster-christmas-bird-count-2/
LOCATION:PA
